<title>THAILAND: Electricity Generating to pay 2 baht div.</title>
<headline>Electricity Generating to pay 2 baht div.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  2.00    vs    1.00</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 April 2, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	May 22, 1997</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is Electricity Generating Plc, a power firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
